      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "This seems to happen when you change avatar while someone is still loading it, or just by doing it very quickly (and this is pretty common way to \"fix\" your avatar from some other visual bugs - you just switch to random one and back to your one, without waiting). So some kind of race condition.\n\nHappened to me multiple times",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
    {
      "__v": 0,
      "_id": "5c6b658caa2b2f77a77d7851",
      "author": {
        "_id": "5ab3ad272b67505f726c2a8f",
        "alias": "Financial Wombat",
        "aliasID": "65ba0620ed6eefce4c68aad8",
        "anonymized": false,
        "avatarURL": "https://canny.io/images/b0df06ce0a7cc3a865aa29ea7072c2a6.png",
        "created": "2018-03-22T13:18:31.099Z",
        "name": "Observer.",
        "serviceAccount": false,
        "urlName": null
      },
      "authorID": null,
      "boardID": "58c62f2b3cf8f8367753b2f0",
      "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
      "created": "2019-02-19T02:10:20.810Z",
      "deleted": false,
      "fileURLs": [],
      "files": [],
      "imageURLs": [],
      "integrationSourceType": null,
      "internal": false,
      "itemSourceType": null,
      "likeCount": 0,
      "mentionedUserIDs": null,
      "mentionedUsers": [],
      "mergeID": null,
      "parentID": null,
      "pinned": false,
      "postDeleted": false,
      "postID": "5c6a3ec2c462930a9f0a6002",
      "private": false,
      "reactions": null,
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "GoToFinal is correct. This has been an issue for at least a year in vrchat to my knowledge. If an avatar is still loading while the user switches to another one that is either cached or loads faster, the slower loading avatar will be switched to once finished loading. This causes a desync for those that load avatars quicker or have one cached already.\n\nI always recommend if people need to switch avatars quickly for a reload they use a public avatar. for non full body users AFK lamp is quick, for full body you will probably need to use a humanoid if you wish to recalibrate otherwise the lamp should be fine to let others reload your avatar.\n\nOtherwise if youre just switching avatars normally the only way to avoid this issue is to provide enough time for everyone to download and load the current avatar before switching.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
    {
