      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "A quick side note: in the same way that an avatar that has been switched out of continues to download, last I checked it is possible to get a world to continue downloading if you hit return to home world while the download is initialising. Although worlds will not suddenly switch like avatars do, it just puts the world in your cache for next time.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
