  "details": "Two streams of the same event, Ruuubick had changed his avatar in that world, but he appeared in different avatars to different people.  \n\nHere he is tall white suit guy:\nhttps://www.twitch.tv/videos/382484749?t=00h46m39s\n\nHere he is a short cube toon character:\nhttps://youtu.be/c8WsZpQaJEI?t=2785\n\nIn the second clip you can see other players looking up, even though the avatar appears short.",
